        <object id="record" label="Record closing inspection&#10;result" description="The MOT centre records the observed odometer reading and inspection identity. If the required observation is unavailable, it records that missing evidence instead of inventing a reading. Tax-authority validation follows." role="MOT centre" system="MOT records (conceptual)" inputs="Vehicle identity&#10;Closing inspection evidence" outputs="Closing MOT reading or missing-evidence notice" added="false" kind="function" model_id="record" phase="Obtain, validate and clarify reading evidence" original_label="Record closing inspection result" tooltip="Record closing inspection result&#10;&#10;The MOT centre records the observed odometer reading and inspection identity. If the required observation is unavailable, it records that missing evidence instead of inventing a reading. Tax-authority validation follows.&#10;&#10;Role: MOT centre&#10;&#10;Application: MOT records (conceptual)&#10;&#10;Inputs: Vehicle identity; Closing inspection evidence&#10;&#10;Outputs: Closing MOT reading or missing-evidence notice">
