        <object id="validate_pair" label="Validate both boundary&#10;readings" description="Check the declaration vehicle and liable period, the presence of both readings, matching vehicle identities, exact period-boundary dates and a closing odometer at least as high as the opening value. A missing, mismatched or decreasing reading blocks assessment." role="Tax authority" system="Tax assessment system (conceptual)" inputs="Declaration and billing period&#10;Opening MOT reading&#10;Closing MOT reading or missing-evidence notice" outputs="Reading-pair validation result" added="false" kind="function" model_id="validate_pair" phase="Obtain, validate and clarify reading evidence" original_label="Validate both boundary readings" tooltip="Validate both boundary readings&#10;&#10;Check the declaration vehicle and liable period, the presence of both readings, matching vehicle identities, exact period-boundary dates and a closing odometer at least as high as the opening value. A missing, mismatched or decreasing reading blocks assessment.&#10;&#10;Role: Tax authority&#10;&#10;Application: Tax assessment system (conceptual)&#10;&#10;Inputs: Declaration and billing period; Opening MOT reading; Closing MOT reading or missing-evidence notice&#10;&#10;Outputs: Reading-pair validation result">
