        <object id="resolve_issue" label="Review and correct&#10;inspection evidence" description="Review the original inspection evidence. Supply corrected or confirmed readings when supported by evidence; otherwise record that the required boundary reading cannot be established. Never estimate a missing verified boundary reading silently." role="MOT centre" system="MOT records (conceptual)" inputs="Reading clarification request&#10;Original inspection evidence" outputs="Corrected or confirmed reading evidence&#10;Unresolved-evidence finding, when applicable" added="true" kind="function" model_id="resolve_issue" phase="Obtain, validate and clarify reading evidence" original_label="Review and correct inspection evidence" tooltip="Review and correct inspection evidence&#10;&#10;Review the original inspection evidence. Supply corrected or confirmed readings when supported by evidence; otherwise record that the required boundary reading cannot be established. Never estimate a missing verified boundary reading silently.&#10;&#10;Role: MOT centre&#10;&#10;Application: MOT records (conceptual)&#10;&#10;Inputs: Reading clarification request; Original inspection evidence&#10;&#10;Outputs: Corrected or confirmed reading evidence; Unresolved-evidence finding, when applicable">
