        <object id="reconcile" label="Reconcile remaining&#10;settlement balance" description="Calculate final assessed tax minus all net cash posted to the declaration: advances plus additional receipts minus refunds transferred. Use the recorded amounts, not invoices or authorisations. A partial receipt or any residual overpayment prevents closure." role="Tax authority" system="Tax ledger (conceptual)" inputs="Final tax assessment&#10;All ADVANCE and ADDITIONAL receipts&#10;All confirmed REFUND payments" outputs="Remaining settlement balance" added="true" kind="function" model_id="reconcile" phase="Reconcile all cash and close only a cleared settlement" original_label="Reconcile remaining settlement balance" tooltip="Reconcile remaining settlement balance&#10;&#10;Calculate final assessed tax minus all net cash posted to the declaration: advances plus additional receipts minus refunds transferred. Use the recorded amounts, not invoices or authorisations. A partial receipt or any residual overpayment prevents closure.&#10;&#10;Role: Tax authority&#10;&#10;Application: Tax ledger (conceptual)&#10;&#10;Inputs: Final tax assessment; All ADVANCE and ADDITIONAL receipts; All confirmed REFUND payments&#10;&#10;Outputs: Remaining settlement balance">
