  <diagram id="p2-notes" name="Notes">
    <mxGraphModel dx="1400" dy="900" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="1220" pageHeight="1450" math="0" shadow="0" background="#ffffff">
      <root>
        <mxCell id="0" />
        <mxCell id="notes" value="Model notes" parent="0" />
        <object id="notes-title" label="P2 | Model notes" kind="annotation">
          <mxCell vertex="1" parent="notes" style="shape=text;html=0;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=30;fontStyle=1;fontColor=#243d4a;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=0;">
            <mxGeometry x="50" y="40" width="1120" height="55" as="geometry" />
          </mxCell>
        </object>
        <object id="notes-subtitle" label="MOT verification and final settlement" kind="annotation">
          <mxCell vertex="1" parent="notes" style="shape=text;html=0;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=21;fontStyle=1;fontColor=#243d4a;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=0;">
            <mxGeometry x="50" y="100" width="1120" height="40" as="geometry" />
          </mxCell>
        </object>
        <object id="notes-summary" label="Complete proposed EPC from the end of the billing period through reading validation, assessment, cash&#10;settlement and final closure. Unresolved evidence, unpaid amounts and unconfirmed refunds remain explicit&#10;open-case outcomes." kind="annotation">
          <mxCell vertex="1" parent="notes" style="shape=text;html=0;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=16;fontStyle=0;fontColor=#243d4a;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=0;">
            <mxGeometry x="50" y="160" width="1120" height="81" as="geometry" />
          </mxCell>
        </object>
        <object id="assumptions-title" label="Scope and assumptions" kind="annotation">
          <mxCell vertex="1" parent="notes" style="shape=text;html=0;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=21;fontStyle=1;fontColor=#243d4a;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=0;">
            <mxGeometry x="50" y="275" width="1120" height="34" as="geometry" />
          </mxCell>
        </object>
        <object id="assumption-1" label="1. This extends the existing conceptual operating model. New case registers, payment confirmation checks, transfer&#10;   services and workflow states are proposed; the current SQLite prototype does not execute these tasks or store&#10;   their complete histories." kind="annotation">
          <mxCell vertex="1" parent="notes" style="shape=text;html=0;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=15;fontStyle=0;fontColor=#243d4a;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=0;">
            <mxGeometry x="50" y="325" width="1120" height="75" as="geometry" />
          </mxCell>
        </object>
        <object id="assumption-2" label="2. The original demonstration assumes valid opening and closing readings. This proposed EPC broadens that&#10;   assumption to allow missing or inconsistent evidence and a clarification loop. The five existing demonstration&#10;   cases can continue to use valid readings." kind="annotation">
          <mxCell vertex="1" parent="notes" style="shape=text;html=0;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=15;fontStyle=0;fontColor=#243d4a;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=0;">
            <mxGeometry x="50" y="413" width="1120" height="75" as="geometry" />
          </mxCell>
        </object>
        <object id="assumption-3" label="3. The initial settlement comparison uses advance cash actually received. Subsequent completion checks use all net&#10;   cash posted to the declaration, including additional receipts and completed refunds." kind="annotation">
          <mxCell vertex="1" parent="notes" style="shape=text;html=0;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=15;fontStyle=0;fontColor=#243d4a;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=0;">
            <mxGeometry x="50" y="501" width="1120" height="54" as="geometry" />
          </mxCell>
        </object>
        <object id="assumption-4" label="4. Tax rates and rounding remain the case assumptions: BEV 3 pence per mile; PHEV 1.5 pence per mile; round once to&#10;   the nearest penny with half-pennies upwards." kind="annotation">
          <mxCell vertex="1" parent="notes" style="shape=text;html=0;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=15;fontStyle=0;fontColor=#243d4a;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=0;">
            <mxGeometry x="50" y="568" width="1120" height="54" as="geometry" />
          </mxCell>
        </object>
        <object id="assumption-5" label="5. No legal reminder deadlines, penalties, fraud investigation, appeals or debt-collection process are introduced.&#10;   Open outcomes explicitly require later follow-up." kind="annotation">
          <mxCell vertex="1" parent="notes" style="shape=text;html=0;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=15;fontStyle=0;fontColor=#243d4a;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=0;">
            <mxGeometry x="50" y="635" width="1120" height="54" as="geometry" />
          </mxCell>
        </object>
        <object id="assumption-6" label="6. An unconfirmed refund is not assumed failed or safe to retry. Confirmation and duplicate-reference checks must&#10;   precede recording or retrying transfers." kind="annotation">
          <mxCell vertex="1" parent="notes" style="shape=text;html=0;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=15;fontStyle=0;fontColor=#243d4a;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=0;">
            <mxGeometry x="50" y="702" width="1120" height="54" as="geometry" />
          </mxCell>
        </object>
        <object id="editing-title" label="Using the editable diagram" kind="annotation">
